---
description: Continue work from the latest verified checkpoint
alwaysApply: true
---

Maintain one active work item and subtask. After each atomic subtask: review
changes, run the smallest relevant verification, record the result, update
`current-task.md`, `checkpoint.json` and `verification-matrix.md`, set the exact
next action, and continue.

When an item becomes VERIFIED, update completed work, work plan and current
state before selecting the next item. Persist checkpoint and handover before
session end or context loss.
